"A pair of industrial grade ear plugs, they are attached together by some "
"string.  They hang around your neck, use them to plug them in."
msgstr ""
"Zsinórral egymáshoz rögzített ipari füldugó. Jelenleg a nyakad körül lógnak,"
" fülbe rakásukhoz aktiváld."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
